		{
			"id": "eJpv79TAI4NzKObMj",
			"description": "Heavy Bolt Pistol",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Fielded by Primaris Space Marines (Bladeguard Veterans, Inceptors and others), current Codex background is explicit that the heavy bolt pistol fires a larger case than the legacy bolt pistol, closing most of the gap with a full boltgun in a sidearm's frame.\n\nDesign: \"Heavy\" is taken literally: it is given the full Godwyn boltgun anchor damage (6dx2(2) pi++ / 6d cr ex follow-up) rather than the reduced pistol line above, on a bigger, ST 11† frame with a magazine (14 rounds) between the standard pistol's 8 and the boltgun's 24. Range and Acc sit above the lighter bolt pistol because the larger case gives a flatter trajectory and better sight radius.",
