		{
			"id": "e4H1nPzgeJl4u1HPp",
			"description": "Heavy Bolter",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Imperium's standard support-weapon bolter, tripod- or vehicle-mounted, firing an oversized bolt round; consistently shown chewing through infantry and light vehicles alike while remaining useless against a main battle tank's frontal armour.\n\nDesign: This is the project's second fixed anchor: 7dx2(2) pi++, follow-up 8d cr ex (exact dice distribution computed with a Python script, not just averages). Checked against the vehicle armour table: AV10 (DR 100, e.g. a Sentinel or a Chimera's side) has effective DR 50 against the armour divisor (2); 7dx2 averages 49 and penetrates 41% of hits, \"chewing\" light vehicles about 40% of the time as required. AV11 (DR 150, Rhino front/sides, effective DR 75) drops to 0.1%, and AV12-14 (DR 200-350) are effectively 0%, so it does not reliably hurt medium- or heavy-armoured vehicles - both outcomes match the assignment's check. Against a suit of Astartes power armour (DR 100, effective DR 50) it penetrates the same 41% of hits, and it essentially never beats a Terminator (DR 200, effective DR 100) - a support weapon that threatens infantry and armour alike but not the heaviest plate. ST 14 and ROF 6 reflect a genuine support weapon needing a mount or a very strong shooter (only Astartes or a braced tripod).",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Astra Militarum",
				"Adeptus Astartes"
			],
			"tech_level": "10",
			"legality_class": "1",
			"base_value": "3500",
			"base_weight": "60 lb",
			"weapons": [
				{
					"id": "WUx03sxzi9mJReiD8",
					"sv": 1,
					"damage": {
						"type": "pi++",
						"base": "7dx2",
						"armor_divisor": 2
					},
