		{
			"id": "e-3zdcRJirOB-HDjz",
			"description": "Stalker Bolt Rifle, Primaris Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A precision, semi-automatic-only bolt rifle firing subsonic ammunition for use by Vanguard Primaris squads and scout patterns operating covertly; background stresses stealth and one-shot precision over rate of fire.\n\nDesign: Penetrator dice are unchanged from the Godwyn anchor (6dx2(2) pi++; the subsonic load does not need to lose penetration to stay quiet), but the follow-up drops from the anchor's 6d cr ex to 4d cr ex, the same one-third cut as the old scale's 3d-to-2d: a subsonic round has less kinetic energy at impact to trigger a full-yield detonation of the internal charge. Acc is the best of any weapon on this page (integral optics, single shots only, RoF 1) and Bulk is worse (-5) for the built-in suppressor/barrel shroud.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Astartes"
			],
