		{
			"id": "eT5biDkkkJGXSdHxK",
			"description": "Combi-Weapon, Bolter/Melta",
			"local_notes": "Lore: As above; the melta-pattern auxiliary barrel is the combi-weapon most sought by squads expecting armour, since it turns a bolter-armed Space Marine into a one-shot tank-killer for the price of a single melta charge.\n\nDesign: Bolter barrel is the Godwyn anchor (6dx2(2) pi++, follow-up 6d cr ex). Melta barrel reuses the meltagun's short/beyond-½D damage split unchanged (8dx6(10) burn / 4dx6(3) burn beyond, see Melta Weapons) for a single shot; this also fixes a stale line from before this rescale where the beyond-½D barrel was left as bare \"4d burn\" with no multiplier or divisor at all, out of step with the meltagun's own beyond-½D formula.",
