			"description": "Combi-Weapon, Bolter/Flamer",
			"local_notes": "Lore: As above; the flamer-pattern auxiliary is common on Sternguard and Deathwatch loadouts for clearing entrenched infantry without giving up ranged bolter fire.\n\nDesign: Bolter barrel is the Godwyn anchor (6dx2(2) pi++, follow-up 6d cr ex). Flamer barrel reuses the standard Flamer's damage and follow-up unchanged (see Flame Weapons, not part of this rescale) for a single one-shot fuel reservoir.",
